+  - allow to set HTTP Header to WebSocketApp(ISSUE#27)
+  - fix typo in pydoc(ISSUE#28)
+  - Passing a socketopt flag to the websocket constructor(ISSUE#29)
+  - websocket.send fails with long data(ISSUE#30)
+
